  "all_ingredients_flat": "firm tofu, chickpea flour, baking powder, turmeric powder, black pepper powder, kala namak, onion powder, garlic powder, salt, plant-based milk, chives, cilantro, parsley, bell peppers, mushrooms, onion",
  "instructions": "Remove water from tofu by pressing in kitchen towel. BATTER: Blend all the ingredients (except herbs) in a high speed blender until the batter becomes smooth with no lumps and consistency like pancake batter. OMELETTE: On a non-stick pan, pour a ladle full of batter. Cook well on one side on low or medium heat. When it starts forming bubbles and it's cooked on one side, flip carefully and cook the other side too. FILLING: Add chives, cooked bell peppers, mushrooms & onions. Serve them hot.",
  "cooking_methods": [
